stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Draft - author holds it" as Draft
    state "In review - counsel pack assembled" as Review
    state "Cleared - usable verbatim on its channels" as Cleared
    state "Suspended - channels listed for withdrawal" as Suspended
    state "Withdrawn - readable only as history" as Withdrawn
    state "Superseded by a newer cleared version" as Superseded

    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Review: Submitted, evidence present and commencement named
    Review --> Draft: Counsel returns it with a reason
    Review --> Cleared: Clearance recorded with reviewer, date and scope
    Cleared --> Suspended: Watch item fires, or an EV row is re-graded in section 02
    Cleared --> Suspended: Corrigendum check older than the re-check age
    Suspended --> Review: Primary source re-pulled, capture date refreshed
    Suspended --> Withdrawn: Evidence no longer supports the wording
    Cleared --> Superseded: A successor version reaches Cleared

    note right of Cleared
        No transition from Draft straight to Cleared.
        No edit in place - a change of wording is a new version.
        The assistant may read Cleared entries and nothing else.
    end note

    note right of Suspended
        A suspension is lifted only through re-verification,
        never by approval alone.
        Dependent copy is withdrawn from its channels first.
    end note
